Package: hecdssr
Title: R Interface to HEC-DSS (Hydrologic Engineering Center Data Storage System)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("HEC", "Developer", , "hecdss@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R interface to the HEC-DSS library for reading and writing
    time series data in DSS version 7 files. Mirrors the architecture of the
    hec-dss-python library: a thin Rcpp shim over the hecdss C API, with all
    higher-level logic implemented in R. Time series are returned as xts
    objects with metadata stored as xts attributes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/HydrologicEngineeringCenter/hec-dss-r
BugReports: https://github.com/HydrologicEngineeringCenter/hec-dss-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: HEC-DSS native library (>= 7-JA-7); run tools/download_hecdss.R from a clone to fetch it.
Imports:
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.0),
    R6,
    xts,
    zoo
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    data.table
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
